  "closed": "∀ {x y z w : ℝ}, (3 / 2 * Real.sqrt ((x ^ 2 + y ^ 2) * (w ^ 2 + z ^ 2)) + Real.sqrt ((x ^ 2 + w ^ 2) * (y ^ 2 + z ^ 2) - 3 * x * y * z * w) - (x + z) * (y + w)) ≥ 0",
  "informal": "By C-S and AM-GM，we have \\n\\n $\\frac{3}{2}\\sqrt{(x^2+y^2)(w^2+z^2)}+\\sqrt{(x^2+w^2)(y^2+z^2)-3xyzw}-(x+z)(y+w)$ \\n\\n $\\ge{\\frac{3}{2}(wx+yz)}+\\sqrt{(xy+wz)^2-3xyzw}-(x+z)(y+w)$ \\n\\n $=\\frac{1}{2}(wx+yz)+\\sqrt{x^2y^2-xyzw+w^2z^2}-(wz+xy)$ \\n\\n $\\ge{\\sqrt{xyzw}+\\sqrt{x^2y^2-xyzw+w^2z^2}-(wz+xy)}$ \\n\\n $=\\sqrt{ab}+\\sqrt{a^2-ab+b^2}-(a+b)\\ge{0}$ \\n\\n Where $a=xy,b=wz$",
